GitHub Actions Interview Questions

Today I revised interview-focused GitHub Actions concepts commonly asked in DevOps roles.

🔹 DevOps Scenarios
Interviewers may ask about:
Automating builds and deployments
Managing secrets securely
Handling multi-environment pipelines
Focus on real use cases.

🔹 CI/CD Use Cases
Common questions include:
When to use GitHub Actions
Integrating with cloud platforms
Designing efficient pipelines
Explain with practical examples.

🔹 Troubleshooting Questions
Be ready to discuss:
Debugging failed workflows
Fixing permission issues
Optimizing slow pipelines
Problem-solving skills matter.

🔥 3-Line Takeaway
Scenarios test understanding.
 CI/CD shows expertise.
 Troubleshooting proves skill.
